      "fTerm": "LADDERS (<b>E04F 11/00</b> takes precedence; step-stools <b>A47C 12/00</b>; adaptation of ladders to use on ships <b>B63B</b>, to use on aircraft <b>B64</b>; scaffolding <b>E04G</b>)<b>[5,6]</b>",
