      "level": 1,
      "parent": "E01C23/00\\",
      "ja": "未硬化の舗装における凹部またはその類似の溝の作成，処理または充てん用装置，例．継ぎ目または枠印をつけるためのもの（表面の模様付けＥ０１Ｃ１９／４３）；そのための移動式型枠（非移動式型枠Ｅ０１Ｃ１１／０２）；未硬化舗装にそう入物または移動式のそう入支持体をそう入するための装置（Ｅ０１Ｃ２３／０４が優先；非移動式のそう入物支持体Ｅ０１Ｃ１１／０２）",
      "en": "Devices for making, treating, or filling grooves or like channels in not-yet-hardened paving, e.g. for joints or markings (surface patterning E01C 19/43); Removable forms therefor (non-removable forms E01C 11/02); Devices for introducing inserts or removable insert-supports in not-yet-hardened paving (E01C 23/04 takes precedence; non-removable insert supports E01C 11/02)",
      "count": 122,
      "ipcCode": "E01C23/02",
      "fTerm": "2D053",
