      "level": 1,
      "parent": "E04G23/02\\",
      "ja": "修繕，構造的変更をしない。構造的変更となる新たな部材を付加しない。〔建造時の欠陥を修正する。建造時より弱くなった部分を初期の強度に戻す。〕〔例；補修診断方法と装置，クラック補修用テ－プ〕",
      "en": "Without repairs, constractural changes, or additions to be constractural changes.  (Repairing  defects having appeared at the time of the constructions. Reinforcing the fragiel parts into regular strength.), e.g. repair diagnosing methods and its arrangements,  tapes for repairing crack fissures",
